<title>JAPAN: Simree -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Simree -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.02		vs	   17.93</p>
<p> Operating   loss 528    million	  vs     loss 1.76</p>
<p> Current     loss 485    million	  vs     loss 1.74</p>
<p> Net	   loss 492    million	  vs     loss 1.75</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 42.71 yen	  vs   loss 152.26 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Simree Co Ltd is a catalogue mail-order sales firm for clothing.</p>
